Package: styledscriptures-data
Version: 0.12
Section: python
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3
Maintainer: Reuben Institute <reubeninstitute@gmail.com>
Description: Reuben Institute's Psalms and Parashot text
 Markdown text and CSV metadata for Reuben Institute's own
 typesetting of the Psalms (as poetry) and Parashot (as narrative
 prose) — the text behind the print booklets, web app, and video
 series.
 .
 Fixed reference data (parashah verse ranges) lives under
 /usr/share/styledscriptures. Editable content (episode tracking,
 psalm/parashah text) lives under /var/lib/styledscriptures and is
 meant to be edited in place (e.g. via MediaStudio); it is
 overwritten on package upgrade, so edits must be committed back to
 the source repo first.
